description	"Swamp Trooper

Hazmat Troopers with gritty ambush tactics.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee

^8Attributes:
- Environmental Protection (1)
- Stamina (1)
- Close Combat Training (1)
- Battery Recharge (2)
- Blast Armor
- Tracking Beacon

^8Abilities:
- Sprint (1) ^3[CS2]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Quickthrow (3) ^3[CS3]
"